---
/**
 * Protein Energy's "how it works". Copy supplied by the client (protein, glucose, caffeine, "energy"). The
 * claims are flagged for legal review; no amounts are stated until the formula is final
 * (see the flag in step 2, and ProteinEnergyBenefits.astro).
 */
import ProductStep from '@/components/product/ProductStep.astro';
import ImagePlaceholder from '@/components/ui/ImagePlaceholder.astro';
---

<section id="how-it-works" class="on-dark section-px section-py overflow-hidden bg-charcoal text-white">
  <div class="container-lg">
    <div class="flex flex-wrap items-end justify-between gap-6">
      <h2 class="display-word stretch-display text-[clamp(2.2rem,5vw,4.25rem)] leading-[0.88] text-pink">How it works</h2>
      <p class="max-w-[34ch] text-xl leading-[1.4]">Protein to build. Carbs to fuel. Caffeine to get you moving.</p>
    </div>

    <ol class="mt-[clamp(40px,5vw,72px)] grid gap-[clamp(20px,3vw,32px)]">
      <ProductStep number={1} dot="blink" tone="dark">
        <Fragment slot="title">Your protein fix just got a lot more fun.</Fragment>
        <Fragment slot="body">
          <span data-copy-review="PENDING - Notion §5 Layer C wording is 'Protein + glucose + caffeine in a convenient chewable format' and the back-of-pack line 'combines 10g of protein with glucose and caffeine'. 'high-quality protein' (source not final; whey isolate considered, which brings milk allergen labeling) and 'selected energy-supporting ingredients' (B6/B12 only optional) go beyond that.">
            Protein Energy combines high-quality protein with glucose, caffeine and selected energy-supporting ingredients in a chewy gummy format.
          </span>
        </Fragment>
        <ImagePlaceholder slot="image" />
      </ProductStep>

      <ProductStep number={2} dot="burst" imageFirst tone="dark">
        <Fragment slot="title">The formula backs it up</Fragment>
        <Fragment slot="body">
          <span data-copy-review="PENDING - Notion Regulatory & Compliance §5: the formula is a target only (protein 10 g, glucose 5 g, caffeine 50 mg, 4 gummies per serving). Step 2 stays a placeholder until it is final.">
            The exact formula is still being finalized. Once it's locked in, this is where we'll explain what's inside and why.
          </span>
        </Fragment>
        <ImagePlaceholder slot="image" />
      </ProductStep>

      <ProductStep number={3} dot="burst" tone="dark">
        <Fragment slot="title">Just chew, enjoy and get on with it.</Fragment>
        <Fragment slot="body">
          No powder.<br>No shaker.<br>No sad protein bar.
        </Fragment>
        <ImagePlaceholder slot="image" />
      </ProductStep>
    </ol>
  </div>
</section>
